  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consolidating SIBDP and Moving Forward: Outreaching and Communication Component by RedOrange</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a continuation to consolidate our past activities related to BDP 2100 i.e Formulation of BDP2100, SIBDP and Accelerating Implementation of BDP.  The project consists of the following components:
1.	Completing the unfinished work (e.g. finalizing Regional Plans, Investment Plans, policy briefs, developing and institutionalizing M&amp;E Tools, Knowledge Portal, etc.) (Partner CEGIS);
2.	Strategic Support to GED in completing their work, strengthening BDP implementing capacity, attracting investment (Partner CEGIS);
3.	Strengthening foothold of BDP 2100 by aligning Spatial Planning Framework (of Urban Development Directorate) to BDP 2100 (Partner BIP);
4.	Impact Advocacy for BDP2100 (Partner (BIP);
5.	Integrating BDP2100 knowledge and science behind it (mostly the NL innovation and knowledge) into academic arena (partner: UIU);
6.	Outreaching and Communication (RO, under a separate activity);
7.	Training and Capacity Building (CEGIS, UIU, BIP, RO).</narrative>
  </description>
